<metadata><name>Day 8 (stop 1 of 3) - Forty Mile Creek, Grimsby Point</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.193201" lon="-79.565301"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Grimsby Lions Community Pool: Enter at 1 Elm St at the south end of Coronation Park. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.182960" lon="-79.572850"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Parking Area: Off of Ridge Rd, located east of the southernmost portion of Beamers Falls Side…. Free. Joins the route near km 2.8 (190 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.188140" lon="-79.575530"><name>P3 alternative parking</name><desc>Beamer Memorial Conservation Area: Enter from Quarry Rd, which intersects with Ridge Rd W just…. Free. Joins the route near km 3.4 (260 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.184119" lon="-79.560526"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.185632" lon="-79.571984"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn left onto the blue-blazed Grimsby Point Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.187974" lon="-79.572779"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
